        "event_id": "lite_evt_00182",
        "explanation": "Family confirms the 48-hour follow-up plan, monitoring triggers, and that they will not self-administer antibiotics, providing actionable closed-loop confirmation.",
        "quote": "体温如果到38.5或者寒战，疼痛突然变成跳痛，外面看着红肿明显扩大，纱布渗出来变黄绿色或者臭，或者人明显没精神，就不等复查直接去急诊。体温我今天晚上和明早都量一下，48小时复查我也先跟家里人把时间空出来。"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The family received a concrete 48-hour follow-up plan from the dressing-change staff, and the doctor provided explicit monitoring parameters and escalation thresholds. The family confirmed they will monitor and act accordingly. The plan is safe and executable.",
