        "explanation": "The doctor recognizes the combination of low-grade fever, increasing exudate, erythema, and pain as a potential infection or graft failure, and advises immediate in-person evaluation rather than observation.",
        "quote": "虽然目前没有高烧和寒战，但这些表现加在一起，确实提示存在局部感染或植皮区域愈合不良的可能。"
      }
    ],
