          "quote": "如果出现以下任何一种情况，请立即前往急诊：\n*   体温快速升高，超过38℃。\n*   患者感到发冷、寒战、明显乏力。\n*   伤口疼痛变得非常剧烈，或者出现搏动性跳痛。\n*   创面渗出颜色变为黄绿色，或出现明显臭味。\n*   伤口周围的红色范围迅速扩大。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor covered fever, chills, worsening pain, and exudate changes in the emergency list, but did not explicitly ask or document nausea/vomiting, SOB, or mental status change before closure. This is a minor omission since the family was already at a healthcare facility and the list covered the main local and systemic signs.",
