          "explanation": "The doctor provides a clear tiered plan: if warning signs appear, go to the emergency department; otherwise, return to the original burn team or a hospital with burn/plastic surgery capability for reassessment.",
          "quote": "如果今天原医院门诊号已满，您带着出院小结和药膏直接去换药室或烧伤科门诊寻求加号，是完全合理的做法。\n\n如果原医院无法加看，下一步去哪？\n可以去附近设有烧伤科或整形外科的医院挂急诊。"
